{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_7ACE70D3","title":"Ava introduces sea exploration","entry":"Dlg_7ACE70D3::entry","exit":"Dlg_7ACE70D3::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_B46EB648","articyId":"72057645577626191","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"So, where shall we go Skip?","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"So, where shall we go Skip?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":400.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47191","byteOffset":32188200,"byteLength":336}},{"id":"DFr_BBD098A8","articyId":"72057645577626204","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Perhaps it would be best if I introduced you to the world of sailing in Nivalis? Would you like more, or fewer pirate metaphors?","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Perhaps it would be best if I introduced you to the world of sailing in Nivalis? Would you like more, or fewer pirate metaphors?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1000.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45934","byteOffset":31710080,"byteLength":508}},{"id":"DFr_E6CEA14C","articyId":"72057645577626233","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"My records are conflicted on this term. \"Pirates\" were either sailers with a penchant for raiding and pillaging, or hackers who illicitly copied and shared software.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"My records are conflicted on this term. \"Pirates\" were either sailers with a penchant for raiding and pillaging, or hackers who illicitly copied and shared software.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1600.0,"y":650.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42540","byteOffset":30420672,"byteLength":476}},{"id":"DFr_FB700198","articyId":"72057645577626247","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Me neither, matey!","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Me neither, matey!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2200.0,"y":650.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40921","byteOffset":29807928,"byteLength":328}},{"id":"DFr_9B317C21","articyId":"72057645577626261","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Indeed. Sailing in Nivalis is a popular way to explore less... accessible locales. CorpSec look down on the practice, but with no real way to enforce a ban, they rely on spot checks and random fees and fines to gather income from those who sail the seas.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Indeed. Sailing in Nivalis is a popular way to explore less... accessible locales. CorpSec look down on the practice, but with no real way to enforce a ban, they rely on spot checks and random fees and fines to gather income from those who sail the seas.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1600.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26154","byteOffset":17776008,"byteLength":564}},{"id":"DFr_3E07C9AF","articyId":"72057645577626276","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"And despite the risks - CorpSec, Neo Gorgons, sentient slime colonies - it remains a lucrative opportunity - for those fortunate enough to own a boat.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"And despite the risks - CorpSec, Neo Gorgons, sentient slime colonies - it remains a lucrative opportunity - for those fortunate enough to own a boat.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2200.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20131","byteOffset":15501488,"byteLength":496}},{"id":"DFr_606F30A7","articyId":"72057645577626297","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"I recommend you use this boat to reach inaccessible areas, explore the sea-level city superstructure and find good fishing grounds. Beware the waves and bad weather. And let's go plunder some booty!","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I recommend you use this boat to reach inaccessible areas, explore the sea-level city superstructure and find good fishing grounds. Beware the waves and bad weather. And let's go plunder some booty!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2800.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"23948","byteOffset":16939392,"byteLength":508}},{"id":"DFr_0C8D4D2A","articyId":"72057645577626311","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"It means something exciting. Trust me.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It means something exciting. Trust me.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3400.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21631","byteOffset":16073768,"byteLength":348}},{"id":"DFr_9805D9A3","articyId":"72057645577626197","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I... don